The unmodified hardware package executes through the MIT fm1-emu CPU and SoC
runtime, with ARM64 JIT on Android. The firmware and its contents retain the
publisher's and respective component owners' terms. The emulator's MIT license
and this app's GPL license do not grant a license to the firmware itself.
This package is distinct from M-VAVE's public FM1 Open source preview and V15
recovery image; no V15-specific resource license is asserted for V16.
